setNeverImprovedTooltip:
{HEADER}Improved equipment{/HEADER}{BODY}Taking an Improved device off costs 200 bonds, so it never leaves a tank by accident - you paid to move it somewhere else.

With this on, the mod never puts one back: the slot keeps the bounty or standard device you replaced it with, and the saved set is updated to match, so those 200 bonds stay spent exactly once.
An Improved device still on the tank is not affected - moving it between slots or loadouts of the same tank is free.{/BODY}

setNeverExperimentalTooltip:
{HEADER}Experimental equipment{/HEADER}{BODY}Only level 1 Experimental equipment comes off for free with WoT Plus; from level 2 on, removing it costs you - which makes putting it back the same mistake as with Improved equipment.

With this on, the mod never re-installs an Experimental device that is no longer on the tank, and updates the saved set to whatever replaced it.
Turn it off if you would rather have the mod carry your Experimental equipment from tank to tank.{/BODY}
